Name: statcram panel
Description: Point-and-click statcram for the first-partial topics (describing data, random variables and the CLT, estimation of one mean and one proportion).
Binding: sc_app
Interactive: true

Name: Answer template browser
Description: Study answer bank: search exam-style answer templates by question type, see when each applies, fill the blanks and copy (study use only).
Binding: sc_answers_app
Interactive: true
